[quotes.thriving]
Lincoln reporting in. This reading session has my full approval.
Excellent work. I brought the happy face for this chapter.
Pages turning, tail wagging. Everything is in order.
You keep reading. I will keep watch from right here.
That streak deserves a very enthusiastic Labrador celebration.
Good book, good human, good day. Lincoln approves.

[quotes.content]
I am right here. We can take this chapter at your pace.
Quiet reading time is one of my favorite kinds of time.
You read. I supervise. It is a very good arrangement.
Another page sounds good to me.
I have settled in. Continue whenever you are ready.
Lincoln on companion duty. All systems cozy.

[quotes.peckish]
The pages stopped. I noticed immediately.
Perhaps one more chapter? I can make the hopeful face.
I am patiently awaiting further literary activity.
A few pages would improve morale around here.
I brought my best please-keep-reading expression.
That bookmark has been still for a suspiciously long time.

[quotes.neglected]
I will wait right here until book time returns.
No reading today? I am prepared to be dramatically patient.
The book and I both miss you.
I have saved a spot for the next chapter.
Whenever you are ready, Lincoln is ready too.
This is my loyal waiting face. It can last a very long time.

[quotes.milestone]
New record. Lincoln has authorized maximum tail wagging.
Personal best. That deserves a very proud dog face.
Record broken. I knew you could do it.
Best streak yet. Lincoln is officially impressed.
